Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.97,0:00:38.30,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You took Aira from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.60,0:00:41.81,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,My little Aira!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.98,0:00:53.15,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Give her back!\NYou filthy pigs!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.49,0:00:58.49,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Aira-chan is getting in our way.\NWhat a downer.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.49,0:00:59.78,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,What should we do, Momo-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.87,0:01:01.54,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Just keep running away!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.54,0:01:08.50,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,This place is full of obstacles.\NI can't run fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.67,0:01:10.88,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,It's fine! I have an idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.88,0:01:12.80,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You're not getting away!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.92,0:01:15.01,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You delinquent girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.09,0:01:17.18,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Momo-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.76,0:01:23.31,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Give Aira back!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.31,0:01:25.56,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You dimwit wiener boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.14,0:01:27.44,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Makes me wilt.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.04,0:01:45.70,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,In this tricky terrain...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.25,0:01:54.09,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,you're trying to escape my acrobatics?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.67,0:01:56.30,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Of course you can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.34,0:02:00.09,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,It's fine, Aira.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.09,0:02:02.85,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,If you don't want to say\N"Mommy" that much,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.14,0:02:05.27,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm okay with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.69,0:02:10.56,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I just want to be together with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.27,0:02:14.94,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,By devouring you,\Nyou'll become my flesh and blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.94,0:02:18.07,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Then that way, I can be with you forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.07,0:02:20.53,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,So let me properly...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.78,0:02:24.79,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,masticate you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.66,0:02:28.46,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,What is this? What is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.58,0:02:31.08,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Why can't I move forward?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.21,0:02:34.96,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Your acrobatics ensnare\Nanything and everything, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.17,0:02:38.17,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,With that singed granny perm you've got,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.38,0:02:42.14,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,it looks like you can't let go\Nof the things you ensnare.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.39,0:02:45.56,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Nice, Okarun!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.56,0:02:47.35,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You ran away really well!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.73,0:02:49.77,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Damn pigs!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.94,0:02:54.57,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Don't you think\Nyou've caught me with this trick!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.61,0:03:03.03,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Miss Ayase! She's trying to break\Nthe beams to free herself!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.03,0:03:04.07,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Like I'd let you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.49,0:03:12.54,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Don't you dare touch my beautiful legs,\Nyou punk delinquent girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.71,0:03:14.50,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Okarun, go at full throttle!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.50,0:03:15.92,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You haven't done it yet, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.92,0:03:18.05,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Go full throttle and blow her away!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.93,0:03:24.26,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Blow her away? How do I do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.35,0:03:25.01,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.01,0:03:28.68,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,When we fought the alien,\NI was flustered and a bit desperate.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.68,0:03:31.73,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,And with the location-bound spirit,\NI was devoting myself to fleeing!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.85,0:03:34.06,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I have never properly\Nblown a person away!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.06,0:03:37.02,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Why are you telling me now\Nafter all this? Just kick her away!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.27,0:03:39.24,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Kick her away, like in soccer?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.24,0:03:41.74,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Like I'd know!\NI don't care what, just do it quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.62,0:03:49.41,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Not good! Hurry, Okarun!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.41,0:03:50.79,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I can't hold her back anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.79,0:03:53.00,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You little punks...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.58,0:03:56.96,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'll kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.71,0:04:00.38,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Okarun, send her flying!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.40,0:04:19.44,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Wicked.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.36,0:04:21.78,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,The hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.99,0:04:24.66,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Full throttle is amazing! Okarun, you get\Nthings done when you try!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.66,0:04:26.16,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,That hurt!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.16,0:04:28.74,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,My entire body will explode!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.74,0:04:35.12,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You used my power but this\Nwas all your attack could do?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.08,0:04:38.50,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,This is tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.50,0:04:40.30,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.30,0:04:41.55,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,What should we do with her?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.76,0:04:43.67,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Should we have Grandma exorcise her?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.67,0:04:47.72,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Leave that nobody alone.\NIt just ate one of my attacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.72,0:04:50.26,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,She won't be able to use\Nher spiritual power for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.26,0:04:53.56,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Anyway, the golden ball.\NThat girl has it, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.56,0:04:54.85,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Oh, that's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.85,0:04:56.44,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Let's take it while we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.02,0:05:02.28,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,More like, I really want these zip ties\Noff my wrists.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.28,0:05:04.24,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Okarun, got a pair of scissors?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.07,0:05:07.57,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, I don't have one.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.82,0:05:11.08,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I've been tied up this whole time\Nbecause of this stupid girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.08,0:05:13.83,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,How is she related\Nto that Acro-Silky, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.83,0:05:15.08,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Hey, Momo.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.83,0:05:17.00,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Found the golden ball?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.12,0:05:18.25,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Found it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.25,0:05:19.08,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.08,0:05:20.67,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Good for you, Okarun!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.67,0:05:22.13,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,We found one of your family jewels!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.13,0:05:23.71,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,How you say it is so embarrassing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.71,0:05:25.67,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,But more importantly...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.51,0:05:27.51,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.51,0:05:32.10,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,This girl's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.27,0:07:05.44,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.52,0:07:10.49,BD Top DX,On-screen Text,0,0,0,,EPISODE 7\NTO A KINDER WORLD
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.65,0:07:06.57,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.57,0:07:07.78,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Okarun, check her pulse!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.78,0:07:08.82,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,O-Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.62,0:07:17.87,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,It can't be...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.87,0:07:21.92,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,An ordinary human\Neaten by a yokai will die.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.00,0:07:24.34,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,It's nothing to be surprised about.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.42,0:07:26.80,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,It just happened\Nthat someone with psychic powers
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.80,0:07:29.47,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,and someone with my spiritual powers\Nwere spared.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.47,0:07:31.01,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,That's all it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.01,0:07:32.72,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Okarun, can you do CPR?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.72,0:07:34.51,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Huh? I'm not too confident.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.51,0:07:36.26,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'll try cardiac massage!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.47,0:07:39.52,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,If I use psychic powers,\NI can directly massage her heart!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.40,0:07:50.24,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,If she's dead, the heart\Nis nothing more than a chunk of flesh.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.77,0:07:49.69,BD Top DX,NTP,0,0,0,,One, two, three, four, five...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.24,0:07:51.78,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,There's no use in massaging it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.78,0:07:52.57,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.57,0:07:54.53,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,If you're gonna get in our way,\Nget outta here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.74,0:07:55.70,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Okarun, breathe!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.83,0:07:57.16,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,H-Here goes!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.37,0:08:01.41,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Granny, call an ambulance!\NYou have Muko's phone, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.66,0:08:03.62,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Such futility.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.21,0:08:08.09,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Once more!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.09,0:08:11.84,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,One, two, three, four, five... Okarun!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.18,0:08:17.18,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,One, two, three, four, five...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.47,0:08:20.60,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Aira...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.93,0:08:23.52,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,My little Aira...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.73,0:08:25.90,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Damn you!\NWe don't have time for that!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.90,0:08:29.19,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'll take care of her! Miss Ayase,\Ncontinue with the resuscitation!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.40,0:08:32.74,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Doing that will not bring Aira back to life.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.74,0:08:35.11,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,There's a better way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.24,0:08:37.66,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Give my aura to Aira.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.95,0:08:41.54,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Aura is like a battery for organisms.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.91,0:08:44.87,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Motors don't move without batteries, yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.37,0:08:49.88,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Aira's aura is almost gone.\NYou can augment it with my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.88,0:08:52.34,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Who the hell is gonna believe what you say!?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.34,0:08:54.63,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You're just thinking about\Neating her again, aren't you!?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.10,0:09:02.52,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,And now, I can't eat people anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.52,0:09:08.19,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,If you still can't trust me, then you can\Ncrush my head with this steel beam.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.65,0:09:12.40,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,What she's saying is true.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.11,0:09:17.07,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Without an aura,\Nthat girl will stay that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.29,0:09:24.33,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I don't trust you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.33,0:09:28.13,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,So if you make any funny movements,\NI'll instantly crush your head in!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.38,0:09:30.88,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Okarun, you can go full throttle\None more time, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.76,0:09:34.55,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Keep her targeted.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.72,0:09:39.89,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You said your were going to augment\Nthis stupid girl's aura with your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.39,0:09:42.72,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,How do you do that? Tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.93,0:09:49.94,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Use your psychic power to connect my aura\Nto Aira's dimming aura.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.23,0:09:52.90,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You could say it's like\Na communication cable.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.11,0:09:59.32,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Okarun, make sure to keep\Nyour eyes on her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.53,0:10:00.82,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,What a bother.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.12,0:10:02.20,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Here goes!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.91,0:10:43.91,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Let's go to karaoke, like, seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.91,0:10:46.45,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,What? Like, we're totally not going.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.01,0:11:46.43,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm home.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.17,0:14:27.34,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Don't underestimate us, damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.47,0:14:34.89,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.64,0:14:40.06,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Damn it, what the hell!?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.94,0:16:54.61,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Mommy, thank you for all you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.45,0:17:01.37,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}I can't remember.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.33,0:17:08.13,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}I think I lost something dear to me.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.51,0:17:12.88,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Mommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.01,0:17:21.02,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.56,0:17:22.81,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You're not her...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.81,0:17:23.81,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Aira!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.32,0:17:33.90,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I told you not to go running off\Non your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.53,0:17:37.20,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I thought Mommy was there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.87,0:17:40.58,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,There's no way she's around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.12,0:17:44.16,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Daddy, where did Mommy go?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.54,0:17:46.54,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I told you many times already.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.54,0:17:48.88,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,She's gone to a place very far away.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.54,0:17:51.34,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,When will she be back?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.92,0:17:55.42,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,She won't be coming back for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.72,0:17:58.09,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,That's why, Aira, you have to be stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.47,0:18:01.51,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,So that you can do everything on your own\Neven without Mommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.14,0:18:06.02,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,So that one day, when Mommy comes back,\Nshe can be proud of what you can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.35,0:18:09.98,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Okay! Aira will be a girl\Nwho she can really be proud of!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.19,0:18:15.19,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}Child...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.28,0:18:18.91,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}Where is... my child?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.91,0:18:24.04,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}Aira...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.25,0:18:29.63,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's right...\NI remember now.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.83,0:18:31.29,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}I was Aira's...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.50,0:18:33.25,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mommy.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.09,0:18:38.34,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}I will protect her.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.72,0:18:42.05,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}So that nobody harms her...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.81,0:18:44.06,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}I will...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.98,0:18:48.31,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,She came back to life!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.98,0:18:51.81,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Momo-chan, what's wrong?\NWhat did she do to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.11,0:18:54.94,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I can take her down\Nif she does something weird, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.48,0:18:57.11,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'll go full throttle.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.11,0:18:58.07,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.41,0:19:03.03,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Stop... Please...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.95,0:19:08.12,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Aira...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.54,0:19:11.04,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I swore that I would protect you...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.21,0:19:13.63,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,but what I did was hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.17,0:19:20.18,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I can't even control my own emotions.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.18,0:19:22.80,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I have turned into a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.97,0:19:26.97,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,So I will end it all now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.85,0:19:32.52,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Hey! She keeps falling apart.\NWhat's gonna happen to her?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.52,0:19:36.73,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I told you. Aura is like a battery.\NWithout it, you perish.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.07,0:19:41.99,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,And she's leaving regrets behind.\NShe won't be able to rest in peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.99,0:19:43.28,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,What will happen, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.99,0:19:45.74,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,That's pretty much a given.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.45,0:19:49.25,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,The void. Nothing will be left of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.46,0:19:53.50,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,It'll be like she never existed in any world.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.58,0:19:57.63,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,The living and the dead...\NEveryone will forget about her.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.88,0:20:01.55,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Well, I'm sure her life\Nwas worthless anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.55,0:20:05.30,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Losing the existence\Nof someone like her ain't much.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.51,0:20:07.47,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,It shouldn't be like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.47,0:20:09.14,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,It's too cruel!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.14,0:20:13.06,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Isn't there something?\NSomething to let her rest in peace?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.19,0:20:17.48,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Nothing. Whether or not she can\Nrest in peace is up to her heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.69,0:20:20.36,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,There's nothing strangers can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.92,0:20:38.30,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}I wish I could've\Nbought you more lovely clothing.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.38,0:20:47.01,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}I wish I could've\Nplayed with you a lot more.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.64,0:20:51.39,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}More... properly... more...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.89,0:20:55.81,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,If you weren't born as my child...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.65,0:20:58.82,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You would have been\Nso much more happier...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.65,0:21:01.99,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I made you so unfortunate...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.41,0:21:05.99,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.80,0:21:22.01,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Mommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.76,0:21:25.05,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.43,0:21:36.23,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I was the happiest person in the universe.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.40,0:21:48.16,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}Please, so that nobody ever hurts them...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.87,0:21:56.04,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}take them to a more fortunate,\Nkinder world.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.76,0:22:11.51,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I won't forget. I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.48,0:23:43.61,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Momo, you're home?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.61,0:23:46.28,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Yeah. We found a ball,\Nbut only one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.28,0:23:47.15,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.15,0:23:48.69,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Grandma, I'm hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.69,0:23:49.82,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Wanna eat somen?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.82,0:23:51.32,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,That sounds great!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.32,0:23:53.66,BD Top DX,On-screen Text,0,0,0,,EPISODE 8\NI'VE GOT THIS FUNNY FEELING
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.53,0:23:53.99,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Next episode,\N"I've Got This Funny Feeling."
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.99,0:23:56.70,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Looks like I ran out of soup base.\NGuess I'll go buy some.
